  m_text: 'Permissions of the Table Manager

    1. Create tables.

    2. Use table
    templates.

    3. Access "Host Privileges" within the table.

    Apart from
    the above privileges, as the same as regular members, table admin cannot use
    features like kicking out or muting players, or managing the waiting list. They
    also cannot view data or hand history that normal admin can access.'
