  Back_Button: {fileID: 482965765}
  Tip_Button: {fileID: 724850005}
  TipMessage: 'Agents can be assigned as sub-agents to the super agents, and clubs
    can manage more agents through Super Agent function.

    Please note,

    After
    assigning an agent as a sub-agent to a super agent, the data of the sub-agent
    will be continuously counted and added to the data of the super agent. Before
    assigning the sub-agent to the super agent, please pay attention to the data
    of the sub-agent to avoid double counting.'
